menu "LVGL UI Configuration"

    config LVGL_TASK_PRIORITY
        int "LVGL Task Priority"
        default 5
        range 1 24
        help
            Priority of the LVGL task (1-24).
            Higher values = higher priority.

    config LVGL_TICK_PERIOD_MS
        int "LVGL Tick Period (ms)"
        default 5
        range 1 100
        help
            Timer tick period for LVGL internal tick counter.
            Lower values = more responsive but higher CPU usage.

endmenu
